query
SELECT l.id AS left_id, r.id AS right_id FROM adv_left AS l CROSS JOIN adv_right AS r ORDER BY l.id, r.id;
----
+------------------+------------------+
|          left_id |         right_id |
+------------------+------------------+
|                1 |                2 |
|                1 |                3 |
|                2 |                2 |
|                2 |                3 |
+------------------+------------------+
Total record(s): 4

query
